Key: ldlj_minjerk
Source: Analytic continuous LDLJ for the minimum-jerk speed profile 30
        tau^2 - 60 tau^3 + 30 tau^4: DLJ = INT_0^1 (60-360u+360u^2)^2
        du / v_peak^2 = 720/1.875^2 = 204.8 exactly; LDLJ =
        -log(204.8). Package uses forward-difference jerk + rectangle
        integral; tol=1e-3 covers the O(1/n) convergence (n=20001, err
        2.5e-4).
